---
description: TypeScript frontend inside the Rails app
globs: ["app/frontend/**/*.ts", "app/frontend/**/*.tsx", "app/javascript/**/*.ts", "app/javascript/**/*.tsx"]
---
- Strict TS; no any or @ts-ignore. Use generated types for all server payloads; never edit generated files.
- All HTTP goes through app/frontend/api (CSRF token, JSON headers, typed errors). No fetch in components.
- Never re-implement business rules or permissions in TS; the server is the authority.
- Initial data comes from serialized props (or Inertia props), not a fetch on mount.
- Test with Vitest + RTL by role/label; MSW mocks must match request spec JSON.
- Run `pnpm typecheck` and the related test after edits.
